{"id":701,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It always strikes a pose before going for its finishing move. Sometimes opponents take advantage of that time to counterattack."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It drives its opponents to exhaustion with its agile maneuvers, then ends the fight with a flashy finishing move."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"In combat, Hawlucha leaps nimbly about, taking advantage of its opponents’ blind spots. It’s also skilled at using superb submission holds."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It overwhelms opponents with quick moves, but sometimes it showboats for too long when it’s using a special move and gets itself into a pinch."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"With its wings, it controls its position in the air. It likes to attack from above, a maneuver that is difficult to defend against."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"Although its body is small, its proficient fighting skills enable it to keep up with big bruisers like Machamp and Hariyama."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Limber","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's limber body prevents it from being paralyzed."},{"name":"Unburden","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Speed stat if the Pokémon's held item is used or lost."},{"name":"Mold Breaker","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unimpeded by the Ability of the target."}],"eggGroups":["Flying","Human-Like"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Green","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":701,"name":"Hawlucha","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,468],[4,17],[8,197],[12,332],[16,227],[20,297],[24,280],[28,340],[32,269],[36,355],[40,14],[44,560],[48,136],[52,283],[56,143]],"machine":[512,332,97,226,776,34,413,280,339,370,811,91,409,814,227,283,203,263,206,297,7,374,19,411,264,416,447,270,63,442,67,490,679,398,182,240,156,179,157,317,214,444,164,241,129,14,36,269,851,168,675,9,885,369,918,